==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Croconator]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Deathkory]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Ackey]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*7 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*5 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
*5 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
